abstract: "An open CC BY 4.0 empirical dataset of 818 observed Apple Store in-store pickup restock transitions, sellout window durations (median 120.0s across 810 closed events), local-hour distributions, and 5.26M polling check latency quantiles across 31 hub stores in the US, UK, China, and Japan."
